  data: {
    LLM: '1. **Deal**: Four cards each. 2. **Tricks**: Play four tricks; players must follow suit if possible, otherwise may play any card. Highest card of led suit wins and leads next trick. 3. **Knocking**: After players have viewed cards, and at any time during the hand, a player may knock to raise stake by one. 4. **Responses**: Other players choose to stay in or fold; folded players lose current stake and stop participating in the hand. 5. **Result**: Winner of trick four avoids hand loss; other staying players lose according to total stake.',
    Player: '1. **Deal**: Four cards each. 2. **Tricks**: Play four tricks; players must follow suit if possible, otherwise may play any card. Highest card of led suit wins and leads next trick. 3. **Knocking**: After players have viewed cards, and at any time during the hand, a player may knock to raise stake by one. 4. **Responses**: Other players choose to stay in or fold; folded players lose current stake and stop participating in the hand. 5. **Result**: Winner of trick four avoids hand loss; other staying players lose according to total stake.',
    objective: 'Avoid hand penalties by winning the fourth (last) trick, or by folding at favorable moments when stakes rise.',
    gameplay: '1. **Deal**: Four cards each. 2. **Tricks**: Play four tricks; players must follow suit if possible, otherwise may play any card. Highest card of led suit wins and leads next trick. 3. **Knocking**: After players have viewed cards, and at any time during the hand, a player may knock to raise stake by one. 4. **Responses**: Other players choose to stay in or fold; folded players lose current stake and stop participating in the hand. 5. **Result**: Winner of trick four avoids hand loss; other staying players lose according to total stake.',
    keyRules: [
      'No trumps.',
      'Only the fourth trick decides the hand winner.',
      'Knocking raises stake for everyone still active.',
      'The last player to knock cannot knock again until someone else has knocked.',
      'A player cannot knock and fold to that same knock.',
    ],
